<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SOCCER-COLLATED AFRICAN CLUB COMPETITION RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-COLLATED AFRICAN CLUB COMPETITION RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collated results of African club competition first round, second leg matches played at the weekend:</p>
<p>African Champions Cup:</p>
<p>Desportivo Travadores (Cape Verde Islands) v Mouloudia Alger (Algeria) postponed</p>
<p>Kaloum Stars (Guinea) 1 Udoji United (Nigeria) 1</p>
<p>Udoji United won 4-2 on aggregate</p>
<p>FC BFV (Madagascar) 0 Ferroviario Maputo (Mozambique) 1</p>
<p>Ferroviario Maputo won 5-0 on aggregate</p>
<p>Sonacos Diourbel (Senegal) 0 Raja Casablanca (Morocco) 2</p>
<p>Raja Casablanca won 5-1 on aggregate</p>
<p>Daring Club Motema Pembe (Zaire) 3 Mbilinga (Gabon) 2</p>
<p>Mbilinga won 6-4 on aggregate</p>
<p>Ascot (Chad) 2 Africa Sports (Ivory Coast) 1</p>
<p>Africa Sports won 4-2 on aggregate</p>
<p>Notwane (Botswana) 1 Primeiro Agosto (Angola) 2</p>
<p>Primeiro Agosto won 3-2 on aggregate</p>
<p>Saint George (Ethiopia) 1 Zamalek (Egypt, holders) 1</p>
<p>Zamalek won 3-1 on aggregate</p>
<p>APR FC (Rwanda) 0 Mufulira Wanderers (Zambia) 1</p>
<p>Mufulira Wanderers won 5-1 on aggregate</p>
<p>Djoliba (Mali) 1 Club Africain (Tunisia) 1</p>
<p>Club Africain won 4-3 on aggregate</p>
<p>St Pierroise (Reunion) 3 Sunrise Flacq United (Mauritius) 0</p>
<p>St Pierroise won 4-2 on aggregate</p>
<p>Al Hilal (Sudan) 0 Kenya Breweries (Kenya) 0</p>
<p>0-0 on aggregate. Al Hilal won 5-4 on penalties</p>
<p>Junior Professionals (Liberia) 2 Goldfields (Ghana) 1</p>
<p>Goldfields won 4-2 on aggregate</p>
<p>Express (Uganda) 4 Caps United (Zimbabwe) 2</p>
<p>Caps won 7-6 on aggregate</p>
<p>Roma Rovers (Lesotho) 0 Orlando Pirates (South Africa)</p>
<p>Pirates won 1-0 on aggregate</p>
<p>African Cup Winners' Cup:</p>
<p>Mansoura (Egypt) 2 Al Merreikh (Sudan) 0</p>
<p>Mansoura won 3-0 on aggregate</p>
<p>Julius Berger (Nigeria) 3 UNB (Benin) 0</p>
<p>Julius Berger won 6-0 on aggregate</p>
<p>St Louisienne (Reunion) 3 Scouts Club (Mauritius) 1</p>
<p>St Louisienne won 4-3 on aggregate</p>
<p>Red Stars (Seychelles) walkover v Maxaquene (Mozambique) withdrew</p>
<p>Jomo Cosmos (South Africa) 3 Eleven Men in Flight (Swaziland) 0</p>
<p>Jomo Cosmos won 6-0 on aggregate</p>
<p>Dynamos (Zimbabwe) 1 Bata Bullets (Malawi) 0</p>
<p>Dynamos won 2-0 on aggregate</p>
<p>Arab Contractors (Egypt, holders) 2 Mumias Sugar (Kenya) 0</p>
<p>Arab Contractors won 2-0 on aggregate</p>
<p>Nchanga Rangers (Zambia) 5 Lerotholi Polytechnic (Lesotho) 0</p>
<p>Nchanga Rangers won 6-0 on aggregate</p>
<p>Real Bamako (Mali) 1 Royal Armed Forces (Morocco) 0</p>
<p>Royal Armed Forces won 4-2 on aggregate</p>
<p>Progresso (Angola) 1 FC 105 Libreville (Gabon) 0</p>
<p>FC 105 Libreville won 2-1 on aggregate</p>
<p>Etoile Sahel (Tunisia) 4 Etoile Filante (Burkina Faso) 0</p>
<p>Etoile Sahel won 4-3 on aggregate</p>
<p>Hearts of Oak (Ghana) 2 ASFAG (Guinea) 0</p>
<p>Hearts of Oak won 2-0 on aggregate</p>
<p>Mouloudia Oran (Algeria) 4 US Goreenne (Senegal) 1</p>
<p>Muloudia Oran won 4-2 on aggregate</p>
<p>Racing Bafoussam (Cameroon) v Umeme FC (Uganda) postponed</p>
<p>SO Armee (Ivory Coast) 2 V. Club Pointe-Noire (Congo) 1</p>
<p>SO Armee won 2-1 on aggregate</p>
<p>Confederation of African Football (CAF) Cup:</p>
<p>Stade Tamponnaise (Reunion) 1 DSA (Madagascar) 0</p>
<p>1-1 on aggregate. DSA won 4-2 on penalties</p>
<p>Centre Chiefs (Botswana) walkover v Umtata Bucks (South Africa) withdrew</p>
<p>FC Rwanda (Rwanda) 2 Kampala City Council (Uganda) 1</p>
<p>Kampala City Council won 4-2 on aggregate</p>
<p>Aslad Moundou (Chad) 2 AS Bantous (Zaire) 2</p>
<p>3-3 on aggregate. AS Bantous won on away goals rule</p>
<p>C+M Sales (Swaziland) walkover v Textil do Pungue (Mozambique) withdrew</p>
<p>AS Cheminots (Congo) 1 Petro Atletico (Angola) 2</p>
<p>Petro Atletico won 7-1 on aggregate</p>
<p>Kabwe Warriors (Zambia) walkover v Chief Santos (Namibia) withdrew</p>
<p>AFC Leopards (Kenya) 3 Simba SC (Tanzania) 0</p>
<p>AFC Leopards won 4-1 on aggregate</p>
<p>ASKO Kara (Togo) 3 Esperance (Tunisia) 1</p>
<p>Esperance won 8-3 on aggregate</p>
<p>USFA (Burkina Faso) 1 Stade Abidjan (Ivory Coast) 1</p>
<p>USFA won 4-3 on aggregate</p>
<p>Mangasport (Gabon) 2 Asante Kotoko (Ghana) 1</p>
<p>Asante Kotoko won 3-2 on aggregate</p>
<p>ASC la Linguere (Senegal) 0 Kawkab Marakesh (Morocco, holders) 1</p>
<p>Kawkab won 2-0 on aggregate</p>
<p>Jasper United (Nigeria) walkover v Mighty Barolle (Liberia) withdrew</p>
<p>Chabab Mohammedia (Morocco) 2 Horoya (Guinea) 1</p>
<p>Chabab Mohammedia won 2-1 on aggregate</p>
</text>
